      "source_en": "Cancel",
      "text": "Abbrechen"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "35",
      "source_jp": "イベント進行待機に入ります\r\n準備はよろしいですか？",
      "source_en": "You will begin waiting to progress the event.\r\nAre you sure you are ready?",
      "text": "Auf den Start des Ereignisses warten?"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "36",
      "source_jp": "はい",
      "source_en": "Yes",
      "text": "Ja"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "37",
      "source_jp": "いいえ",
      "source_en": "No",
      "text": "Nein"
    },
    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "38",
      "source_jp": "待機を解除しますか？",
      "source_en": "Are you sure you want to cancel waiting?",
      "text": "Warten abbrechen?"
    },
